[{"client_msg_id":"0722a778-7692-4c4e-a672-81523419c621","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/gnachman/iTerm2/blob/master/tests/24-bit-color.sh\u003e","ts":"1625138525.005400","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/gnachman/iTerm2/blob/master/tests/24-bit-color.sh | 24-bit-color.sh\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/gnachman/iTerm2/blob/master/tests/24-bit-color.sh | 24-bit-color.sh\u003e","text":"```\n#!/bin/bash\n#\n#   This file echoes four gradients with 24-bit color codes\n#   to the terminal to demonstrate their functionality.\n#   The foreground escape sequence is ^[38;2;\u0026lt;r\u0026gt;;\u0026lt;g\u0026gt;;\u0026lt;b\u0026gt;m\n#   The background escape sequence is ^[48;2;\u0026lt;r\u0026gt;;\u0026lt;g\u0026gt;;\u0026lt;b\u0026gt;m\n#   \u0026lt;r\u0026gt; \u0026lt;g\u0026gt; \u0026lt;b\u0026gt; range from 0 to 255 inclusive.\n#   The escape sequence ^[0m returns output to default\n\nSEPARATOR=':'\n\nsetBackgroundColor()\n{\n    echo -en \"\\x1b[48${SEPARATOR}2${SEPARATOR}$1${SEPARATOR}$2${SEPARATOR}$3\"\"m\"\n}\n\nresetOutput()\n{\n    echo -en \"\\x1b[0m\\n\"\n}\n\n# Gives a color $1/255 % along HSV\n# Who knows what happens when $1 is outside 0-255\n# Echoes \"$red $green $blue\" where\n# $red $green and $blue are integers\n# ranging between 0 and 255 inclusive\nrainbowColor()\n{ \n    let h=$1/43\n    let f=$1-43*$h\n    let t=$f*255/43\n    let q=255-t\n\n    if [ $h -eq 0 ]\n    then\n        echo \"255 $t 0\"\n    elif [ $h -eq 1 ]\n    then\n        echo \"$q 255 0\"\n    elif [ $h -eq 2 ]\n    then\n        echo \"0 255 $t\"\n    elif [ $h -eq 3 ]\n    then\n        echo \"0 $q 255\"\n    elif [ $h -eq 4 ]\n    then\n        echo \"$t 0 255\"\n    elif [ $h -eq 5 ]\n    then\n        echo \"255 0 $q\"\n    else\n        # execution should never reach here\n        echo \"0 0 0\"\n    fi\n}\n\nfor i in `seq 0 127`; do\n    setBackgroundColor $i 0 0\n    echo -en \" \"\ndone\nresetOutput\nfor i in `seq 255 128`; do\n    setBackgroundColor $i 0 0\n    echo -en \" \"\ndone\nresetOutput\n\nfor i in `seq 0 127`; do\n    setBackgroundColor 0 $i 0\n    echo -n \" \"\ndone\nresetOutput\nfor i in `seq 255 128`; do\n    setBackgroundColor 0 $i 0\n    echo -n \" \"\ndone\nresetOutput\n\nfor i in `seq 0 127`; do\n    setBackgroundColor 0 0 $i\n    echo -n \" \"\ndone\nresetOutput\nfor i in `seq 255 128`; do\n    setBackgroundColor 0 0 $i\n    echo -n \" \"\ndone\nresetOutput\n\nfor i in `seq 0 127`; do\n    setBackgroundColor `rainbowColor $i`\n    echo -n \" \"\ndone\nresetOutput\nfor i in `seq 255 128`; do\n    setBackgroundColor `rainbowColor $i`\n    echo -n \" \"\ndone\nresetOutput\n\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/gnachman/iTerm2|gnachman/iTerm2\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ncs"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ですね。dotfiles の install.sh に生成も含めて仕込んでいます。\nこんな感じで Truecolor の力を得られます。","ts":"1625138453.005000","files":[{"id":"F026CAN5K9V","created":1625138424,"timestamp":1625138424,"name":"Screen Shot 2021-07-01 at 20.20.08.png","title":"Screen Shot 2021-07-01 at 20.20.08.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":586346,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F026CAN5K9V/screen_shot_2021-07-01_at_20.20.08.png","url_private_download":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F026CAN5K9V/download/screen_shot_2021-07-01_at_20.20.08.png","original_h":482,"original_w":2068,"thumb_64":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C4RC8V-F026CAN5K9V-dc865f8cea/screen_shot_2021-07-01_at_20.20.08_64.png","thumb_80":"https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T03C