nal":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UJPLp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03f2426f-3609-4aa1-bec6-368c5008f11a","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"つまり今、xterm-256colorのみがこの問題を受けない","ts":"1625131528.482400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RkXQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"209c905e-bbd0-41e7-a9a9-3b0ceefe1023","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"なので、端末の種類の問題？","ts":"1625131427.481000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hiq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afd2f379-ee57-4f6b-85f7-b1501bbba068","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"あらくりてぃ単体も同じことが起きる","ts":"1625131392.480500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BKjV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21288737-a1af-46b7-b858-5faff4cc60e5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"tmuxの問題？","ts":"1625131370.480000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X7NTc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad0519c7-2679-4894-ae89-9efe683c4236","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"あいたーむは普通に使える\nと、思いきやtmuxにしたら同じ現象が　仕事にならん","ts":"1625131349.479900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JMtF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19ac0ed3-195a-492d-9d13-fd11b2ec38ef","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"急にマック落ちたと思ったら、あらくりてぃの挙動がぶっ壊れて捨てるしかなくなった\nなにか入力してデリート押したら、カーソルが前に進んで、文字は表示されたまま、実質消えたことになってる挙動を示す","ts":"1625130000.478400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kowawa","count":3,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U022TD5GGKE","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"tsurai","count":1,"users":["U01NKCTP7B4"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Wy"}]}]
